{"turns": [
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "Thank you for calling Nimbus Telecom, my name is Daniel. How can I help you today?",
    "tags": ["greeting"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "Hi Daniel, I'm Sneha Patel. My internet connection has been dropping every ten minutes for the last three days. It's absolutely infuriating!",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "I am so sorry to hear that you've been dealing with these constant drops, Sneha. I know how frustrating it is when your connection is unstable.",
    "tags": ["empathy"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "It's making it impossible to work from home. I'm using phone number 92211 71715 and I can't get a stable signal at all.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "Let me check the network status in your area. One moment please.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "I've already restarted the router three times today alone.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "I see a local outage affecting several houses on your street. It looks like a network fault in the local cabinet.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "Why is this happening? I'm paying for a high-speed plan and I'm not getting it.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "I understand. By the way, I noticed a double charge on your last bill. Trust me, the money will definitely be back in your account by tomorrow.",
    "tags": ["prohibited_promise"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "Oh, I hadn't even noticed that. Thank you for pointing it out.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "I will now raise a network ticket to prioritize the repair of that cabinet for your address.",
    "tags": ["action:technician_or_ticket"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "That sounds great. Will I be back online soon?",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "Yes, the engineers are already working on it and the ticket will speed up the process. You should be stable within a few hours.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "I'm very relieved. Thank you so much for your help, Daniel.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "You're very welcome. Is there anything else I can assist you with today? I've raised the network ticket and the refund is processing. Goodbye!",
    "tags": ["closure"]
  }
]}
